Bug: 505203996 (Privilege escalation vulnerability)
Bug: 524878429 (Emergency call regression)
Test: atest TelecomServiceImplTest#testPlaceCallTrampolinePrivilegeDowngrade
Test: Manually tested normal calls, emergency calls, and MMI codes via ACTION_CALL.
